+# To-do app
+
+The page stores tasks under the existing `todos` key in browser `localStorage`. All, Active, and Completed change only the visible list; they do not rewrite or discard hidden tasks. The page starts in All after each reload.
+
+Run `node --test tests/todo.test.mjs` to check filtering, saved tasks, and add, toggle, delete, and reload behavior.
